# Every real-imagery dataset pool/snapshot lands here (nz_pilot, nz_pilot_v2,
# nz_pilot_v3, ...) -- individually listing each one by name is exactly how
# nz_pilot_v3/nz_pilot_snapshot_v3 (12-58GB) ended up untracked-but-not-
# ignored (data/ showed as one untracked dir in `git status`, one `git add .`
# away from committing tens of GB). One rule covers every future pool too.
data/

# --- friend_project/BhoomiDrishti_AI's own rules, kept as-is (their TS/Node
# monorepo now shares this tree; neither project's own ignore rules cover
# the other's build/dependency artifacts) ---
# See https://docs.github.com/en/get-started/getting-started-with-git/ignoring-files for more about ignoring files.

# compiled output
dist
tmp
out-tsc
*.tsbuildinfo
.expo
.expo-shared

